./wiki/entry.md:37:This wiki documents the `agents/` folder, which contains the platform's building blocks: the core agent wrapper, sub-agents, MCP bridging, a decision agent, a meeting primitive, a swarm orchestration pattern, and a graph workflow engine. Other parts of the repository (the TUI, the web app, the MCP servers) are not yet documented here.
