./wiki/entry.md:51:The core [`PiAgent`](agents/pi-agent.md) wraps the SDK and is the base for everything. [`RawPiAgent`](agents/raw-pi-agent.md) extends it to take full control of the system prompt, which is what the higher-level patterns use. [`Workflow`](agents/workflow.md) builds a graph of `RawPiAgent`s connected by interface nodes. [`Meeting`](agents/meeting.md) runs several `RawPiAgent`s in a round-robin discussion, and [`Swarm`](agents/swarm.md) composes a coordinator, a `Meeting`, and an MCP-backed task manager. [`JevAgent`](agents/jev-agent.md) is a standalone decision primitive. [`mcp-bridge`](agents/mcp-bridge.md) is the low-level MCP client shared by the agent and the swarm.
